    "### Section 1.1: Financial Metrics ETL Verification\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective:** Verify that financial metrics were computed correctly during ETL pipeline execution.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Metrics Categories:**\n",
    "- **Valuation**: P/E, P/S, EV/EBITDA, EV/Sales ratios\n",
    "- **Profitability**: Gross/Operating/Net margins, ROE, ROA\n",
    "- **Growth**: Revenue, EBITDA, Earnings YoY growth\n",
    "- **Leverage**: Debt-to-equity, Debt-to-assets\n",
    "- **Target vs Price**: Analyst target upside/downside\n",
    "- **Sector-Specific**: P/TBV (financials), R&D intensity (tech/healthcare)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs:**\n",
    "- `outputs/eda/financial_metrics/quality_alerts.json`\n",
    "- `outputs/eda/financial_metrics/metrics_dashboard.json`\n",
    "- Critical metrics coverage validation"
   ],
